---
<section id="education" class="relative text-amber-500 min-h-min flex flex-col justify-center py-20 px-6 overflow-hidden scroll-mt-24">
  
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full mb-12">
    <h2 class="text-4xl font-bold border-b-4 border-amber-400 text-center  pb-1">Education</h2>
  </div>

  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto w-full flex flex-col gap-8 relative border-l-2 border-neutral-800 pl-6 ml-2 md:ml-auto">
    
    <div class="relative group">
      <div class="absolute -left-[31px] top-1.5 w-4 
      h-4 rounded-full bg-amber-400 border-4 
      border-neutral-950"></div>
      
      <div class="bg-neutral-900/50 border border-neutral-800 p-6 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-400/50 hover:bg-neutral-900">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400 tracking-wider uppercase">2025 - 2029 (forecast)</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-1">Computer Science(graduation)</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3">
            <a href="https://portal.ufcg.edu.br/"
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class= "hover:text-amber-600 leading-relaxed">Federal University of Campina Grande, PB, Brazil</a></p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
        Studies focused on data structures, algorithms, software 
        architecture, database engineering and development, 
        advanced mathematics, object-oriented programming, among other 
        topics related to computing.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="relative group">
      <div class="absolute -left-[31px] top-1.5 w-4 
      h-4 rounded-full bg-amber-400 border-4 
      border-neutral-950"></div>
      
      <div class="bg-neutral-900/50 border border-neutral-800 p-6 rounded-xl transition-all duration-300 hover:border-amber-400/50 hover:bg-neutral-900">
        <span class="text-xs font-semibold text-amber-400 tracking-wider uppercase">2025</span>
        <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-1">Certificate: Web Programmer</h3>
        <p class="text-sm text-gray-400 mb-3">
            <a href="https://moodle.ifrs.edu.br/login/index.php"
            target="_blank" 
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class= "hover:text-amber-600 leading-relaxed">Federal Institute of Rio Grande do Norte (online)</a></p>
        <p class="text-gray-300 text-sm leading-relaxed">
            Short course offered by IFRN on web programming, 
            covering everything from foundational concepts like HTML to databases.
         </p>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>